The new `/orders/report` endpoint only checks for the presence of an API key (via `get_api_key()`) and never verifies the key's scope. The policy explicitly requires `@require_api_key_scope(...)` for API-key endpoints and states that report exports require the `reports:read` scope. Since `ApiKey.scope` defaults to `orders:read`, a key lacking `reports:read` would still pass the presence-only check and expose all orders (including PII).

